      "title": "地平线 6 画质设置说明（演示样例）",
      "author_label": "演示资料作者 E（模拟）",
      "published": "2025-09-05",
      "revision": "r1",
      "relationship": "original",
      "related_ids": [],
      "setting_ids": [
        "fh6.display_mode",
        "fh6.render_resolution",
        "fh6.texture_detail",
        "fh6.texture_filtering",
        "fh6.shadow_quality",
        "fh6.ambient_occlusion",
        "fh6.particle_quality",
        "fh6.anti_aliasing",
        "fh6.vsync",
        "fh6.motion_blur",
        "fh6.frame_rate_limit"
      ],
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "本资料是演示用的模拟说明，不是真实游戏菜单截图或官方文档。设置名称仅用于演示界面分组。"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "columns": ["设置", "建议值", "说明"],
          "rows": [
            ["Texture Detail", "high", "保持纹理细节，优先保留"],
            ["Reflection Quality", "high", "高速场景开销明显，出现尖峰后可下调一级"],
            ["Shadow Quality", "high", "演示预设保持 high"],
            ["Frame Rate Limit", "60", "演示目标上限"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "资料没有给出 CPU、内存、驱动或游戏版本条件，因此这些字段在演示中保持未知。"
        }
      ],
      "limitations": "演示样例；未在真实游戏或真实硬件上核验。"
    },
